  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak. Set aside.\n• Cut sweet potato and carrot into bite-sized chunks. Cut beetroot into 1cm chunks. Trim Fioretto. Halve any thicker stalks of Fioretto lengthways. Zest lemon and slice into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86925cade9b9f0acecf3f/step-1d4b5200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place sweet potato, carrot and beetroot on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 25-30 minutes. Set aside to cool slightly. TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It's done when you can pierce it with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86925cade9b9f0acecf3f/step-03ca7f10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 15 minutes remaining, place Fioretto on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender and brown around edges, 10-15 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86925cade9b9f0acecf3f/step-7378b220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 5 minutes remaining, drain haloumi and pat dry, then cut into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove from heat, add dried oregano, lemon zest, the honey and a splash of water, turning haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86925cade9b9f0acecf3f/step-ddc2fe30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To tray with Fioretto, squeeze over some lemon juice.\n• To tray with veggies, add spinach & rocket mix and a drizzle of vinegar. Gently toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86925cade9b9f0acecf3f/step-f9281b40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roasted veggies between bowls. Top with Mediterranean haloumi and Fioretto.\n• Dollop with yoghurt and babaganoush. Tear over mint and serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86925cade9b9f0acecf3f/step-8eef1d50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
